{"overview":"پنجاه سال پس از اتفاقات «بِلید رنر ۲۰۴۹»، لس آنجلس دوباره زنده شده است، اما نه توسط بشر. کورا، یک فراری که در آخرین تلاش برای توقف فرار، هویت دیگری می‌گیرد: یک بِلید رنر. او مجبور می‌شود با اولون، یک رپلیکنت که روزهای آخر زندگی‌اش را می‌گذراند، شریک شود و به دنبال یک فراری بگردد که حقیقتی را مخفی کرده که می‌تواند شهر شکننده‌شان را به‌هم بزند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Fifty years after the events of Blade Runner 2049, Los Angeles has been reborn, just not by humanity. Cora, a fugitive in a final bid to stop running, takes on one last identity: a Blade Runner. Forced to partner with Olwen, a Replicant days from dying, she hunts down a runaway hiding a truth that could collapse their fragile city.","tagline_en":"Welcome to a future we no longer control.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/dBXuY6kCL2ziWkZF4w4w8hOO7VD.jpg"}],"episodes":8,"crew":["Silka Luisa"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"میشل یئو","role":"Olwen","photo":"/klATAW2KEfV2Glm5uhWAhJWt2ip.jpg","en":"Michelle Yeoh"},{"name":"هانتر شیفر","role":"Cora","photo":"/AilBKow2NuvPBQbvGRx69RxKUBi.jpg","en":"Hunter Schafer"},{"name":"Dimitri Abold","role":"Bebeto Dawkins","photo":"/fkjrNLpVywV5y9hxOW1QwPaDGel.jpg"},{"name":"Lewis Gribben","role":"Elias","photo":"/EpYHJL9DlxVpPDMSwi2wFZwaBd.jpg"}],"trailer":"1d4x_eSdqNc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/171802-blade-runner-2099/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video Free with Ads","kind":"ads","logo":"/fuVBtr57kxnYzOILZ38xqSmBeyR.png"},{"n":"Amazon MX Player","kind":"ads","logo":"/46U3TOB3PhVDjA7qaFOuYSaGMiq.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/171802-blade-runner-2099/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnL